      "message": "Consider enabling (or copying) the following tests for WGSL which exercise similar logic for the SPIR-V backend specifically for Dawn:\n\n* resources/sksl/spirv/CombinedSamplerTypeDawnCompatMode.sksl\n* resources/sksl/spirv/FunctionParametersOfTextureAndSamplerTypeDawnCompatMode.sksl\n* resources/sksl/spirv/WrongCombinedSamplerLayoutSPIRVDawnCompatMode.sksl",
      "revId": "b6cdd538055df78b695328ec154cdd644c8e7673",
